  "identifier": "micropubr",
  "name": "micropubr: Publication-Ready Microbiome Visualizations",
  "description": "A unified, opinionated interface for generating publication-ready microbiome figures from 'phyloseq' objects with minimal code. Applying one consistent design philosophy across the whole microbiome workflow, 'micropubr' provides a consistent family of 'mp_*()' functions covering alpha diversity, beta diversity and ordination, taxonomic composition, differential abundance, phylogenetic trees, co-occurrence networks and longitudinal analyses. Every function returns a 'ggplot2' object with colourblind-safe defaults, automatic statistical overlays and auto-generated, reproducible figure captions.",
